    'All nineteen current bound bilingual descriptions, demand levels, direct relations, applicability and supplied source-reference context were read. Original twenty active JPGs were directly viewed during the closed D-A round. These P bodies neither reuse D case text nor claim image approval.',
    'Fresh application cases were authored independently here; no earlier P profile bodies were read or copied. Only the prior P39 config format was inspected.',
